{"seq":3,"slug":"false-positive-tradeoff","title":"误杀与漏放的阈值权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/realtime-risk-control/risk-decision/false-positive-tradeoff","wordCount":3351,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"误杀与漏放的阈值权衡\">误杀与漏放的阈值权衡</h1><p>风控的阈值定在哪里，从来不是技术问题而是代价问题。技术只负责把&quot;阈值 → 两类错误数量&quot;这条曲线画出来并保证它准确，选择曲线上的哪一点则取决于业务愿意为拦截一笔欺诈付出多少误杀。把这个选择变成拍脑袋的决定，是风控系统最常见的治理缺陷——上线时拍一次，之后再也无人复核，直到某天业务方抱怨&quot;我们最优质的用户被拦得最狠&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>阈值权衡的核心概念是<strong>把分类问题转化为决策问题</strong>。普通分类任务追求准确率，隐含假设两类错误的代价相同；风控必须放弃这个假设。同一个模型、同一批样本，只要改变两类错误的代价比，最优的操作点就会移动——而这个移动与模型好坏无关，纯粹是业务代价结构的反映。理解这一点能避免一个常见误区：业务方抱怨&quot;误杀太多&quot;时，第一反应往往是去改进模型，但很多情况下模型的区分能力已经够好，问题出在阈值被放在了代价结构不支持的位置。</p>\n<p>第二层概念是<strong>代价必须显式</strong>。误杀的代价包含用户流失，漏放的代价包含合规责任，两者都难以精确折算成金额。但&quot;无法精确&quot;不等于&quot;可以不定义&quot;——必须给出一个可辩护的估计，并把它写成配置项而非隐含在某个人的直觉里。显式的代价参数有三个好处：阈值可以被重新计算（当业务假设变化时）、取舍可以被讨论（当双方对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fp}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 有分歧时）、结果可以被归因（当误杀率超标时能立刻定位是代价参数错了还是模型退化了）。</p>\n<p>第三层概念是<strong>约束优先于优化</strong>。业务方给的误杀率上限、监管要求的最小验证比例，都是硬约束而不是偏好。期望损失最小化的解必须先通过约束检查，被约束挡回来时才退到边界上，并显式记录这个偏差。把约束当成软惩罚项混进目标函数，会让系统在不该妥协的时候妥协。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两类错误的代价不对称\">两类错误的代价不对称</h2><p>先把两类错误的定义与代价摆清楚。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误类型</th>\n<th>发生情形</th>\n<th>直接代价</th>\n<th>隐性代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>误杀（false positive）</td>\n<td>正常交易被判风险</td>\n<td>损失这笔交易的手续费收入</td>\n<td>用户流失、品牌损伤、客服成本、监管投诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏放（false negative）</td>\n<td>欺诈交易被判正常</td>\n<td>直接资金损失、拒付赔付</td>\n<td>合规责任、渠道罚款、后续欺诈率上升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两类代价的不对称体现在三个维度上。<strong>量纲不同</strong>：误杀的隐性代价（用户流失）很难折算成金额，而漏放的资金损失是精确的。<strong>可见度不同</strong>：误杀会立刻引发用户投诉，可见度极高；漏放往往在几天后对账或拒付时才暴露，可见度低。<strong>决策者容忍度不同</strong>：业务方通常对误杀极度敏感（因为它立刻影响转化率），对漏放的容忍度取决于是否在可承受的欺诈率预算内。</p>\n<p>正因为可见度不对称，实践中普遍存在<strong>过度拦截倾向</strong>：风控团队倾向于把阈值调低（拦得更多），因为拦截带来的投诉由客服承担，而漏放带来的损失由风控承担。这种激励错位必须用制度纠正——强制统计并公示误杀率，把误杀成本纳入风控团队的考核，或者更彻底地，由业务方与风控共同签署阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"期望损失最小化\">期望损失最小化</h2><p>把阈值选择形式化，最实用的框架是期望损失最小化。设阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，交易风险分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，欺诈先验为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>FPR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fn</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>FNR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(t) = C_{\\text{fp}} \\cdot N \\cdot \\pi \\cdot \\text{FPR}(t) + C_{\\text{fn}} \\cdot N \\cdot (1-\\pi) \\cdot \\text{FNR}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FPR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FNR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FPR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>legit</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FPR}(t) = P(s \\ge t \\mid \\text{legit})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FPR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">legit</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是误杀率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FNR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>fraud</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FNR}(t) = P(s &lt; t \\mid \\text{fraud})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FNR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fraud</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是漏放率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是总交易量。当两个条件分布在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 处连续时，最优阈值满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fn</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^* = \\frac{C_{\\text{fp}}}{C_{\\text{fp}} + C_{\\text{fn}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个结论的形式非常有用：<strong>最优阈值只取决于两类代价的比值</strong>。（代价敏感学习的经典处理见 Elkan, <em>The Foundations of Cost-Sensitive Learning</em>, IJCAI 2001, <a href=\"https://cseweb.ucsd.edu/~elkan/rescale.pdf）如果拦截一笔欺诈的损失是误杀一个正常用户的\">https://cseweb.ucsd.edu/~elkan/rescale.pdf）如果拦截一笔欺诈的损失是误杀一个正常用户的</a> 20 倍，那么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fn</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>21</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fp}} / (C_{\\text{fp}} + C_{\\text{fn}}) = 1/21 \\approx 0.048</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/21</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.048</span></span></span></span></span>——阈值应定在&quot;分数 0.048 以上的都拦&quot;这样低的位置。这个结果初看反直觉（阈值这么低岂不是大量误杀），但它恰恰说明了欺诈损失的量级如何主导决策。</p>\n<p>实践中每一步都需要修正。第一，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fp}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不能只算这笔交易的手续费，要把用户生命周期价值（LTV）的损失折进去，否则会严重低估误杀代价——一个被误杀三次的优质用户可能永久流失，损失未来所有交易的收益。第二，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 要按欺诈类型分层，盗刷的损失是一笔金额，而&quot;薅羊毛&quot;（营销套利）单笔损失极小但量极大。第三，条件分布不可能在真实数据上连续可估，必须用分桶近似。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>欺诈类型</th>\n<th>单笔损失量级</th>\n<th>是否可追回</th>\n<th>建议 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取值依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>盗卡盗刷</td>\n<td>高（数百到数千元）</td>\n<td>部分可追（拒付流程）</td>\n<td>金额 × 追回失败率 + 拒付罚金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账号盗用</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>账户余额 + 关联资产风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营销套利（薅羊毛）</td>\n<td>低（几元到几十元）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>补贴金额 × 规模化因子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚假注册/刷单</td>\n<td>极低单笔</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>按带宽成本与后续风险加权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>骗贷/信贷欺诈</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>授信额度 × 违约损失率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分层阈值而非单一阈值\">分层阈值而非单一阈值</h2><p>单一阈值几乎一定不是最优的，因为不同客群、不同场景的风险先验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 差异巨大。一个成熟的风控系统会做<strong>分层阈值</strong>：先按维度切分，每层内独立定阈值。</p>\n<p>切分维度的选择原则是：<strong>该维度上的先验差异显著，且切分后每层仍有足够样本量支撑统计。</strong> 常用的维度有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>交易场景：新客首单、老客复购、跨境交易、虚拟商品——先验差异可达十倍以上；</li>\n<li>金额区间：小额误杀代价低（用户不介意多加一次验证），大额漏放代价极高；</li>\n<li>渠道与终端：App 内支付 vs Web vs 小程序，可用的信号丰富度不同，能达到的准确率上限不同；</li>\n<li>用户等级：高等级用户的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fp}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 显著更高（LTV 更大）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分层带来两个工程后果。<strong>样本稀疏</strong>：切得太细后每层的正样本可能只有几十个，统计出的先验不可靠，需要用贝叶斯收缩把层内估计向全局均值拉（层级先验）。<strong>一致性风险</strong>：分层后总可能出现&quot;同一用户在两个层之间摇摆&quot;，所以要确保分层维度本身是稳定的属性，而不是实时计算的分数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值不是静态的\">阈值不是静态的</h2><p>把阈值定下来就完事，是另一个常见缺陷。阈值必须随三类变化而调整。</p>\n<p><strong>欺诈率漂移。</strong> 攻击者会针对性地避开高拦截规则，导致整体欺诈率上升、同时现有规则的效果下降。反映在阈值上就是同一条曲线的形状变了。欺诈检测的评测文献把这类随时间发生的分布变化归为概念漂移，并指出它是该领域评测必须显式处理的问题（来源：Lucas &amp; Jurgovsky, <em>Credit card fraud detection using machine learning: A survey</em>, arXiv:2010.06479, 2020, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.06479）。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.06479）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>客群结构漂移。</strong> 大促期间新客占比骤增，而新客的先验欺诈率天然高于老客——如果阈值不变，大促期间的实际欺诈损失会显著上升。这解释了为什么成熟系统在大促前会主动上抬拦截强度（并接受误杀率上升）。</p>\n<p><strong>代价参数变化。</strong> 拒付罚金调整、渠道费率变化、监管新规都会改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；而一旦进入增长期，市场投放成本上升会推高 LTV，从而推高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fp}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>因此阈值的维护必须是一个<strong>周期性复核</strong>动作，而不是一次性配置。复核的输入是过去一个周期的真实表现（实际误杀率、实际漏放率、申诉量），输出是阈值修正建议。这个过程与 <a href=\"../performance-ops/case-feedback-loop\">案件回流、样本标注与模型迭代</a> 共享同一套数据管道——回流产生标注，标注驱动阈值重估。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[历史样本&lt;br/&gt;含事后标签] --&gt; B[分数分桶]&#10;  B --&gt; C[每桶真实欺诈率]&#10;  C --&gt; D[绘制 FPR/FNR 曲线]&#10;  D --&gt; E[代入 C_fp / C_fn]&#10;  E --&gt; F[期望损失最小点 t*]&#10;  F --&gt; G{业务硬约束检查}&#10;  G --&gt;|误杀率超上限| H[上抬阈值至约束边界]&#10;  G --&gt;|合规要求最小拦截率| I[下调阈值至约束边界]&#10;  G --&gt;|通过| J[确认阈值]&#10;  H --&gt; K[灰度发布]&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; L[在线监控实际表现]&#10;  L --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[历史样本&lt;br/&gt;含事后标签] --&gt; B[分数分桶]\n  B --&gt; C[每桶真实欺诈率]\n  C --&gt; D[绘制 FPR/FNR 曲线]\n  D --&gt; E[代入 C_fp / C_fn]\n  E --&gt; F[期望损失最小点 t*]\n  F --&gt; G{业务硬约束检查}\n  G --&gt;|误杀率超上限| H[上抬阈值至约束边界]\n  G --&gt;|合规要求最小拦截率| I[下调阈值至约束边界]\n  G --&gt;|通过| J[确认阈值]\n  H --&gt; K[灰度发布]\n  I --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; L[在线监控实际表现]\n  L --&gt; A</pre><p>图里两个硬约束分支值得展开。<strong>误杀率上限</strong>是业务方给的承诺（例如&quot;整体误杀率不超过 0.5%&quot;），它可能比期望损失最优点更保守，此时阈值被约束推高，代价是更多漏放——这是业务方的选择，风控应当明确记录这个取舍而不是偷偷违背。<strong>合规最小拦截率</strong>来自监管或渠道要求（如特定场景必须做二次验证），它是下界，即使在期望损失上不划算也必须满足。</p>\n<p>还有一类约束是<strong>单规则影响面</strong>：某条规则贡献了总拦截量的 40%，一旦它被误判或需要下线，业务会剧烈波动。这类规则应当被强制降权或拆细，避免系统对单条规则产生依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量-别只看拦截率\">度量：别只看拦截率</h2><p>阈值调优的前提是能准确度量两类错误，而这件事本身比看起来难。</p>\n<p>拦截率（拦截量/总量）几乎是个无用的指标——它同时被攻击强度和阈值驱动，无法说明任何一侧的问题。有用的度量是三组（欺诈检测本质是极端类别不平衡问题，因此 precision/recall 而非准确率才是可用的指标，见 Lucas &amp; Jurgovsky 2020 综述, arXiv:2010.06479, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.06479）：\">https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.06479）：</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>误杀率</td>\n<td>申诉成功量 / 拦截量</td>\n<td>只有申诉的用户被统计，低估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确认欺诈拦截率</td>\n<td>拦截量中确认欺诈的比例（precision）</td>\n<td>需要事后标签，有延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏放率</td>\n<td>事后确认欺诈中未被拦截的比例</td>\n<td>只能统计被发现的欺诈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申诉率</td>\n<td>申诉量 / 拦截量</td>\n<td>代理指标，受客服可达性影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>漏放率有一个根本性的测量缺陷：它只能统计被发现的那部分欺诈。</strong> 未被发现的欺诈（用户没报案、对账没发现）不在分母里。因此漏放率的真实值一定高于统计值，且这个偏差随欺诈手法的隐蔽程度变化。补救手段是引入外部信号（渠道反馈的拒付数据、合作方的风险情报）来扩大&quot;被发现&quot;的覆盖，并在内部对漏放率估计保留安全边际。</p>\n<p>误杀率的低估来自另一个方向：绝大多数被误杀的用户不会申诉，他们直接放弃这笔交易。因此<strong>申诉率只能作为误杀的下界</strong>。更可靠的误杀度量需要主动抽样：对拦截样本每周随机抽取一批做人工复核，用人工判断作为金标准估算真实误杀率。这个抽样复核的成本很低（每周几百条），但它是唯一能给出无偏误杀估计的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>阈值是代价问题不是技术问题；技术负责给出&quot;阈值 → 两类错误&quot;的准确曲线。</li>\n<li>最优阈值由两类代价的比值决定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fn</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^* = C_{\\text{fp}} / (C_{\\text{fp}} + C_{\\text{fn}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>误杀的代价必须包含用户生命周期价值损失，否则被严重低估；可见度不对称会导致系统性的过度拦截倾向，需要用制度纠正。</li>\n<li>单一阈值几乎一定次优，应做分层阈值；分层时要处理样本稀疏（层级先验收缩）与层间一致性。</li>\n<li>阈值随欺诈率、客群结构、代价参数三类变化漂移，必须周期性复核而非一次配置。</li>\n<li>业务误杀率上限与合规最小拦截率是硬约束，可能覆盖期望损失最优点，取舍必须显式记录。</li>\n<li>拦截率是无用指标；误杀率需主动抽样复核才能无偏估计，漏放率因只覆盖已发现欺诈而天然低估。</li>\n<li>这套目标怎么在规则层面落地、上线前怎么验证，见 <a href=\"../rule-engine/rule-simulation\">历史回放验证规则效果</a>；采样复核产生的样本如何回流，见 <a href=\"../performance-ops/case-feedback-loop\">案件回流、样本标注与模型迭代</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"误杀与漏放的阈值权衡","id":"误杀与漏放的阈值权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两类错误的代价不对称","id":"两类错误的代价不对称"},{"level":2,"text":"期望损失最小化","id":"期望损失最小化"},{"level":2,"text":"分层阈值而非单一阈值","id":"分层阈值而非单一阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值不是静态的","id":"阈值不是静态的"},{"level":2,"text":"度量：别只看拦截率","id":"度量-别只看拦截率"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同步拦截、人工审核与异步复核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/realtime-risk-control/risk-decision/sync-block-async-review"},"next":{"title":"设备指纹与环境采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/realtime-risk-control/signals-features/device-fingerprint"}}